---

## Thread-Safe Lazy Initialization

```java id="g6pnr5"
class Singleton {

    private static volatile Singleton instance;

    private Singleton(){}

    public static Singleton getInstance(){

        if(instance == null){

            synchronized(Singleton.class){

                if(instance == null){
                    instance = new Singleton();
                }

            }

        }

        return instance;
    }

}
```

This uses **double-checked locking**.

