### 2. Return Pair (Clean Approach 🔥)
```java id="mps2"
class Pair {
    int maxPath;   // max path anywhere
    int maxDown;   // max downward path

    Pair(int p, int d) {
        maxPath = p;
        maxDown = d;
    }
}

static Pair solve(Node root) {
    if (root == null) return new Pair(Integer.MIN_VALUE, 0);

    Pair left = solve(root.left);
    Pair right = solve(root.right);

    int maxDown = Math.max(root.val,
                    root.val + Math.max(left.maxDown, right.maxDown));

    int throughRoot = root.val + Math.max(0, left.maxDown)
                                 + Math.max(0, right.maxDown);

    int maxPath = Math.max(throughRoot,
                    Math.max(left.maxPath, right.maxPath));

    return new Pair(maxPath, maxDown);
}
```

