To create a Spring Boot Security project that meets the specified requirements, you need to configure Spring Security to allow access to specific endpoints without authentication and require a valid JWT token for others. Below is a step-by-step guide on how to set this up:

### 1. Create a New Spring Boot Project

You can create a new Spring Boot project using Spring Initializr (https://start.spring.io/). Select the following dependencies:

